# Web control plane (Vite). Copy to .env only if you need overrides.
# Local demo needs no secrets — Vite proxies /api → http://localhost:4000
# (see vite.config.ts). Prefer `npm run demo` from the repo root.
# Compose staging: web nginx proxies /api using API_URL=http://api:8080
# (see DEMO_STAGING.md). No VITE_ API key is required.

# Optional: disable HMR / file watching during agent edits
# DISABLE_HMR=true
